B.QO=new A.cv(B.xS,["Plebs.Place","Loading...","Error","Success","Cancel","Confirm","Save","Delete","Edit","Close","OK","Yes","No","Retry","Back","Anonymous forum on Nostr","Feed","No posts yet","Be the first to post!","Pull to refresh","{count} new posts","now","{count}m","{count}h","{count}d","New Post","What are you thinking?","Anonymous message...","Write something...","Publish","Publishing...","Post published successfully!","Error publishing post","Write something to publish","Published!","Failed to publish","Camera","Gallery","Audio","Image","Image too large (max {size}MB)","Audio too large (max {size}MB)","Format not supported","Error selecting image","Error selecting audio","Upload error","Upload failed","Connecting...","Sending {current}/{total}","Ready to send","Upload complete","Settings","Relays","Manage Nostr relays","About","Version","Privacy","Posts are anonymous by default","Language","Change app language","Automatic","Detects device language","Language changed","Portugu\xeas (Brasil)","English (US)","Select Language","Relays","Add Relay","wss://relay.example.com","No relays configured","Connected","Disconnected","Connecting...","Relay added","Relay removed","Invalid relay URL","Board","Board ID","Ex: my-board","Join","Create","Generate Random","Switch Board","Current board","Public Board","S-Board (Secure)","Encrypted messages","Password","Enter board password","Password required for S-Boards","Password must be at least 4 characters","Join Existing Board","Generate New Board","Load S-Board","You are about to create a new public board. Anyone with the ID can join.","Link copied! Share to invite people.","Anonymous Forum","Choose a board to participate","Thematic Boards","New Board","Your Boards","No topics yet","Be the first to create a topic!","New Topic","Topic Title","Content","topics","posts","Reply","replies","{count} replies","Write your reply...","Reply published!","Join Board","Enter the board ID to join. If it's an S-Board, enable the option and enter the password.","Join","Enter the board ID","S-Board (Encrypted)","Password-protected messages","How It Works","Complete Plebs.Place guide","What is Plebs.Place?","Plebs.Place is an anonymous forum based on the Nostr protocol. Your messages are distributed across multiple decentralized relays, ensuring censorship resistance and privacy.","Boards (Groups)","Boards are discussion groups identified by a unique ID. Anyone with the ID can join and participate. Tap on the board bar to create or join a group.","S-Boards (Secure Boards)","S-Boards use AES-256 encryption to protect messages. Only those with the ID and password can read the content. Messages are encrypted before being sent to relays.","Share Boards","On public boards, use the share button on the board bar to copy the access link. Send the link to invite others to join the group.","Attachments (Images and Audio)","You can send images and audio with your messages. Files are fragmented and distributed across relays. Limit of {size}MB per file. Formats: JPG, PNG, GIF, MP3, OGG, M4A.","Privacy","\u2022 No registration or login required\n\u2022 Each message uses a unique key\n\u2022 No link between your messages\n\u2022 IPs are not stored by relays\n\u2022 On S-Boards, content is encrypted","Relays","Relays are servers that store and distribute messages. Your app connects to multiple relays simultaneously for redundancy. If one relay goes down, the others keep working.","Tips","\u2022 Tap on the board bar to switch groups\n\u2022 Tap on a post to see details and copy ID\n\u2022 Use the post ID (note1...) in other Nostr apps\n\u2022 Pull down to refresh\n\u2022 The dice button generates random IDs","Post Details","Post ID copied!","Post ID","Published at","Copy ID","Share","Something went wrong","Connection error","No internet connection","Timeout","Try again","Error loading posts","Error loading image","Encrypted","Decrypting...","Decryption failed","Support the Project","If you enjoy the app, consider sending some satoshis via Lightning Network","Lightning Address","Address copied!","Thank you for your support!","Create New Board","Board ID","Ex: programming, games...","Letters and numbers only, no spaces","Enter a board ID","Enter a board name","ID too short (min. 3 characters)","Only letters and numbers allowed","This board already exists","Display Name","Ex: Programming, Games...","Name too short","Description (optional)","What is this board about?","Board Password","Minimum 4 characters","Password must be at least 4 characters","Create Board","This board already exists on the Nostr network","Error verifying","Topic Details","Reply Details","Original Topic","Send Reply","No replies yet","Error converting","Failed to publish to relays","Error publishing","Wait for upload to finish","Failed to publish. Check your connection.","Failed to load audio","Failed to load","Error playing audio","Copy","Copy Content","Content copied!","Topics","Error selecting image","Error selecting audio","Error sending","Upload error","Enter the topic title","Enter the ID to see friends posts","Enter the board ID you want to access. You will see posts published there.","Encryption Password","Shared secret password","Enter the board ID","New version available!","Click to update","Update","Note ID (to search in Nostr clients)","Event ID (hex)","Paste the Note ID in nostr.band, snort.social or another Nostr client to see the original event","copied!","Be the first to reply!","About","Data","Clear local posts","Removes posts saved on device","Clear all data","Completely resets the app","Clear posts","This will remove all locally saved posts. Posts will remain on relays.","Local posts removed","Clear all","This will:\n\n\u2022 Remove all local posts\n\u2022 Reset the Board ID\n\u2022 Clear settings\n\nThis action cannot be undone.","All data cleared","Clear","Clear all","Join a Board","Enter the ID to see friends posts","Encrypted","Secure board with password - only friends can read","Messages encrypted with AES-256. Only those with the password can read.","Share the ID and password only with trusted friends.","Board ID copied!","eg: abc12345","eg: myFriends","Enter","History","Recently accessed boards","No boards accessed yet","Clear history","Clear board history","Remove all boards from history?","History cleared","Accessed"],t.li)
